# UPTAKE cadence trial — machine-generated, regenerated daily by haus.uptake.snapshot.
# Ignored on purpose: this repo is an arm of the trial, and a ledger that rewrites
# itself every morning would leave it permanently dirty, so every scheduled push
# would look like a real change while carrying none. The ledgers are published
# deliberately at the end of the window, as a dataset, which is a real change.
experiments/traffic-ledger.jsonl
experiments/commit-ledger.jsonl
experiments/snapshot.log
experiments/cadence.log
experiments/localclones.json
experiments/baseline-*.tsv
